    "next_steps": {
      "value": "════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  ✅ Infrastructure provisioned!\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPublic IP:   65.2.203.196\nS3 bucket:   sanyog-conformity-docs-066756667240\nSSH:         ssh ubuntu@65.2.203.196\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n\n1. Confirm SNS email subscription (check your inbox).\n\n2. Add DNS A record in Cloudflare:\n     api.sanyogconformity.com → 65.2.203.196\n   Make sure the orange proxy cloud is ON ☁️\n\n3. Wait 2–3 minutes for EC2 user-data to finish.\n\n4. SSH in and configure secrets:\n     ssh ubuntu@65.2.203.196\n     sudo nano /etc/dice/.env\n   Fill in: DATABASE_URL (Atlas), JWT_SECRET, RAZORPAY_KEY_*, OPENAI_API_KEY\n\n5. Set Atlas IP allowlist to: 65.2.203.196/32\n\n6. Push to GitHub main branch — GitHub Actions deploys automatically.\n\n7. Verify:\n     curl https://api.sanyogconformity.com/health\n",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "s3_bucket_arn": {
      "value": "arn:aws:s3:::sanyog-conformity-docs-066756667240",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "s3_bucket_name": {
      "value": "sanyog-conformity-docs-066756667240",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "sns_topic_arn": {
      "value": "arn:aws:sns:ap-south-1:066756667240:dice-alerts",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ssh_command": {
      "value": "ssh -i ~/.ssh/dice-operator ubuntu@65.2.203.196",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
